WEBVTT

00:16:58.796 --> 00:17:00.156
It was on top.

00:17:00.196 --> 00:17:04.356
It is still regarded
as a horrendously offensive word.

00:17:04.396 --> 00:17:06.756
But here's what I want to leave you with.

00:17:06.796 --> 00:17:08.476
What do you call yours?

00:17:08.476 --> 00:17:10.036
Because as far as I can see,

00:17:10.076 --> 00:17:13.636
words for vulva or cunts
fall into a few categories.

00:17:13.676 --> 00:17:16.556
We've got child-like: a tuppence,

00:17:16.556 --> 00:17:19.076
a Twinkie, a foof, a minky, a Mary.

00:17:20.196 --> 00:17:24.356
Very medical: a vulva, pudendum, vagina.

00:17:24.356 --> 00:17:28.156
Slightly detached: down there,
it's down there.

00:17:28.196 --> 00:17:29.356
(Laughter)

00:17:29.396 --> 00:17:31.796
Bits, special area.